{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35241767/1f3367c2fb2cde7c9285a330571e73396887ff27.png
- 9 new girls added to the game;
- "Trading Cards" can already be viewed in the description on the main page of the game;
- Changed the dimension of puzzles in the direction of relief;
- Enable anti-aliasing for previews;
- Removed extra libraries, which accelerated the launch and exit from the game;
- The quality of graphics at startup is reduced to the options "Low", "Medium" and "Ultra";
- "Ultra" graphics now have anti-aliasing "x8", instead of "x4";
- Applied "MipMapping", most of the images are devoid of any "ladders" (only on the "Ultra"!);
- The game consumes even less resources at launch time;
- Fixed minor bugs;
- The main soundtrack is changed to "Deep House Fashion".
